-	/*
-	 * The hardware ECO for fixing descriptor FIFO sizes is
-	 * not indicated via crypto registers. For this reason, it is
-	 * required to manually check the full soc revision to differentiate
-	 * canoe v1 vs v2.
-	 */
-
